why don't we just have a Latin

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.580
or Romanized alphabet like
the rest of the world.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:58.999
So by 1949, Mao was like ready
to roll, scrapping the entire

00:08:58.999 --> 00:09:03.320
