00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:16.910
And Mao was like, fine.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:20.230
So he kept the Chinese characters
as the main writing system

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:24.080
but for teaching literacy in
school, he developed a written

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.390
alphabet called pinyin.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:29.800
- Pinyin, P-I-N-Y-I-N.

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:31.870
- Where you can use the Roman letters

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:35.440
to spell out Chinese words
