some dangerous outcomes

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.770
in terms of making people
think a certain way.

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:34.350
But at the end of the day, let
us just end on the fact that

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:37.470
China has developed a
really amazing technology

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:40.410
for getting their language
into the computer,

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:41.580
and by doing so,

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:45.500
have been able to pass
any typist in the West,

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:48.210
helping fuel the rise of China

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:50.225
as a technological powerhouse.

